### 🔬 Ghost Comment Investigation & Fix
- **Root cause found**: `gh pr comment sghr/iGeo --repo sghr/iGeo` interprets `sghr/iGeo` as **branch name** (positional arg), not `--repo`
- **Correct syntax**: `gh pr comment 30 --repo sghr/iGeo` (PR number as positional, --repo as flag)
- **Comments ARE being created** but as **line-level review comments** (not visible in `issues/{n}/comments` API, only in PR `.comments` field)
- **Confirmed with PR `.comments` field**: sghr/iGeo went 63→67 this session (+4 from my test comments)
- **Action**: Using correct syntax from this round. All merge promotions verified with PR count increase.

